iAgmHM sc-16g34wp-0 hMBmXV"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 gUBewJ"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 eyPPMA"><img src="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:352,h:80,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/B0QPakuQYmvXlBe7CNLV" srcSet="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:352,h:80,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/B0QPakuQYmvXlBe7CNLV 1x, /images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:704,h:160,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/B0QPakuQYmvXlBe7CNLV 2x" alt="green magnifying glass" width="100%" height="auto" data-qa-id="cta-step-image" style="max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:contain;aspect-ratio:384 / 384;height:auto" loading="lazy" class="sc-7wwekv-0 enKkyd"/></div></div><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 jpQJKV"><h3 class="sc-1oq5f4p-0 gsdsZf"><a href="https://www.idealist.org/en/volunteer" class="sc-12kw2ys-0 hnthed"><div class="sc-908q8o-0 IvetH sc-1ygcmbj-1 cKCCaz"><p class="ql-align-center">Find Volunteer Opportunities</p></div></a></h3><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 cokFpz"><div class="sc-908q8o-0 jXNAga"><p class="ql-align-center">Discover 100,000+ unique ways to volunteer, with opportunities for virtual and onsite opportunities to support 56 different cause areas.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-qa-id="step-1" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 jvgxBv sc-1ygcmbj-0"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 iAgmHM sc-16g34wp-0 hMBmXV"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 gUBewJ"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 eyPPMA"><img src="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:352,h:80,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/6wUhZMDsS5CcvOeEJBTm" srcSet="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:352,h:80,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/6wUhZMDsS5CcvOeEJBTm 1x, /images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:704,h:160,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/6wUhZMDsS5CcvOeEJBTm 2x" alt="blue listing icon" width="100%" height="auto" data-qa-id="cta-step-image" style="max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:contain;aspect-ratio:384 / 384;height:auto" loading="lazy" class="sc-7wwekv-0 enKkyd"/></div></div><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 jpQJKV"><h3 class="sc-1oq5f4p-0 gsdsZf"><a href="https://www.idealist.org/en/orgs/post-free-volunteer-listings" class="sc-12kw2ys-0 hnthed"><div class="sc-908q8o-0 IvetH sc-1ygcmbj-1 cKCCaz"><p class="ql-align-center">Add Your Organization</p></div></a></h3><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 cokFpz"><div class="sc-908q8o-0 jXNAga"><p class="ql-align-center">Share your unique volunteer opportunity with more than 2 million people around the world looking for ways to do good.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-qa-id="step-2" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 jvgxBv sc-1ygcmbj-0"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 iAgmHM sc-16g34wp-0 hMBmXV"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 gUBewJ"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 eyPPMA"><img src="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:352,h:80,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/miem116OTfqswQ694dUH" srcSet="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:352,h:80,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/miem116OTfqswQ694dUH 1x, /images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:704,h:160,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/miem116OTfqswQ694dUH 2x" alt="yellow mouse click" width="100%" height="auto" data-qa-id="cta-step-image" style="max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:contain;aspect-ratio:384 / 384;height:auto" loading="lazy" class="sc-7wwekv-0 enKkyd"/></div></div><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 jpQJKV"><h3 class="sc-1oq5f4p-0 gsdsZf"><a href="https://www.idealist.org/volunteersolutions" class="sc-12kw2ys-0 hnthed"><div class="sc-908q8o-0 IvetH sc-1ygcmbj-1 cKCCaz"><p class="ql-align-center">Explore Business Solutions</p></div></a></h3><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 cokFpz"><div class="sc-908q8o-0 jXNAga"><p class="ql-align-center">Share thousands of virtual and on-site volunteer opportunities with your company’s employees or platform’s audience.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="cms-block-83b78a22d524451f99bb8f0fff336fe3" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 esfmuE sc-1s3itqb-0 gdOTML"><div class="sc-1hrlqpl-0 eIHTIZ"><div><div data-qa-id="split-content-block-2"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 hZDlip"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 bzqtlo"><div data-qa-id="split-content-section-0" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 bWblOJ"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 hCNIUX"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 bCDVPy"><div style="text-decoration:none" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 fIRyka"><div class="sc-908q8o-0 IvetH sc-8dhh8m-0 jvrJmQ"><h2><u>About Us</u></h2></div></div><div class="sc-908q8o-0 IvetH"><p>Over the past 30 years, Idealist and VolunteerMatch have supported millions of people in their quest to build a better world, be it through a job, volunteer opportunity, or by working with neighbors to solve a local problem.</p><p>Since merging in early 2025, our combined organization is connecting more individuals with social-impact opportunities than ever before.</p></div><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 hLDoIQ"><a class="sc-1w2vike-0 eAwYhi primary medium" data-qa-id="cms-button-link" href="/en/about" data-discover="true"><div style="display:inline-flex"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center">Discover Idealist</div></div></a></div></div></div></div><div data-qa-id="split-content-section-1" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 dxSaAo"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 gVGopr"><div class="sc-1r74fx-0 jumPZO"><img src="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:552,h:409,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/RCswVyvTpKVP9IOycCCg" srcSet="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:552,h:409,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/RCswVyvTpKVP9IOycCCg 1x, /images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:1104,h:818,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/RCswVyvTpKVP9IOycCCg 2x" alt="Illustration of a blue browser window with a person icon, upward trending arrow, coffee cup, green leaf, and yellow flower, representing digital growth and productivity." width="552" height="409" data-qa-id="split-content-section-image" style="max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:contain;border-radius:10px;aspect-ratio:1270 / 942;height:auto" loading="lazy" class="sc-7wwekv-0 enKkyd"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="cms-block-c89743c138814ceba88afca71f58c7fb" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 gzxkMY sc-1s3itqb-0 euVFBW"><div class="sc-1hrlqpl-0 eIHTIZ"><div><div data-qa-id="three-step-cta-3" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 fXoUQd"><div class="sc-1x4zfbk-1 kDVayk"><div class="sc-908q8o-0 IvetH sc-8dhh8m-0 sc-1x4zfbk-0 cyzotN ixSbWC"><h2><p class="ql-align-center">The world's largest <u>volunteer recruitment network</u></span></h2></div><div class="sc-908q8o-0 IvetH"><p class="ql-align-center">Idealist is the best place to reach like-hearted individuals to support your organization, community group, or event. Now that VolunteerMatch has joined us, our platform is connecting more volunteers with opportunities to take action than ever before.</p></div></div><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 kesFcZ"><div data-qa-id="step-0" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 jvgxBv sc-1ygcmbj-0"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 iAgmHM sc-16g34wp-0 hMBmXV"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 gUBewJ"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 eyPPMA"><img src="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:352,h:80,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/NVVIyWwzSAiShi6OqsXA" srcSet="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:352,h:80,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/NVVIyWwzSAiShi6OqsXA 1x, /images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:704,h:160,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/NVVIyWwzSAiShi6OqsXA 2x" alt="blue globe" width="100%" height="auto" data-qa-id="cta-step-image" style="max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:contain;aspect-ratio:384 / 384;height:auto" loading="lazy" class="sc-7wwekv-0 enKkyd"/></div></div><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 jpQJKV"><h3 class="sc-1oq5f4p-0 gsdsZf"><a href="https://www.idealist.org/en/orgs/post-free-volunteer-listings" class="sc-12kw2ys-0 hnthed"><div class="sc-908q8o-0 IvetH sc-1ygcmbj-1 cKCCaz"><p class="ql-align-center">Join More Than 200,000 Organizations</p></div></a></h3><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 cokFpz"><div class="sc-908q8o-0 jXNAga"><p class="ql-align-center">Sign up to join our network of nonprofits, social-impact corporations, and community groups using Idealist to find volunteers.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-qa-id="step-1" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 jvgxBv sc-1ygcmbj-0"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 iAgmHM sc-16g34wp-0 hMBmXV"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 gUBewJ"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 eyPPMA"><img src="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:352,h:80,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/KR4sExjKSES2p2vnk6H7" srcSet="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:352,h:80,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/KR4sExjKSES2p2vnk6H7 1x, /images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:704,h:160,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/KR4sExjKSES2p2vnk6H7 2x" alt="green hammer and pencil" width="100%" height="auto" data-qa-id="cta-step-image" style="max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:contain;aspect-ratio:384 / 384;height:auto" loading="lazy" class="sc-7wwekv-0 enKkyd"/></div></div><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 jpQJKV"><h3 class="sc-1oq5f4p-0 gsdsZf"><a href="https://www.idealist.org/en/orgs/volunteer-engagement-resources" class="sc-12kw2ys-0 hnthed"><div class="sc-908q8o-0 IvetH sc-1ygcmbj-1 cKCCaz"><p class="ql-align-center">Explore Resources for Leaders of Volunteers</p></div></a></h3><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 cokFpz"><div class="sc-908q8o-0 jXNAga"><p class="ql-align-center">Check out our library of resources, guides, and webinars for finding and engaging dedicated volunteers to support your cause.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-qa-id="step-2" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 jvgxBv sc-1ygcmbj-0"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 iAgmHM sc-16g34wp-0 hMBmXV"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 gUBewJ"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 eyPPMA"><img src="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:352,h:80,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/dtpbKnQPSwaMAa8SP67t" srcSet="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:352,h:80,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/dtpbKnQPSwaMAa8SP67t 1x, /images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:704,h:160,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/dtpbKnQPSwaMAa8SP67t 2x" alt="yellow puzzle piece" width="100%" height="auto" data-qa-id="cta-step-image" style="max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:contain;aspect-ratio:384 / 384;height:auto" loading="lazy" class="sc-7wwekv-0 enKkyd"/></div></div><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 jpQJKV"><h3 class="sc-1oq5f4p-0 gsdsZf"><a href="https://www.idealist.org/en/about/merger-faq" class="sc-12kw2ys-0 hnthed"><div class="sc-908q8o-0 IvetH sc-1ygcmbj-1 cKCCaz"><p class="ql-align-center">Check Out Frequently Asked Questions</p></div></a></h3><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 cokFpz"><div class="sc-908q8o-0 jXNAga"><p class="ql-align-center">Take advantage of everything that Idealist has to offer and discover how our merger with VolunteerMatch affects you.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="cms-block-3997230303ae441883f40810040dd7ec" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 fMSghj sc-1s3itqb-0 gdOTML"><div class="sc-1hrlqpl-0 beDaIM"><div><div></div></div></div></div><div id="cms-block-51d49693f5a04ea0917542e08f2fac9d" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 esfmuE sc-1s3itqb-0 gdOTML"><div class="sc-1hrlqpl-0 eIHTIZ"><div><div data-qa-id="split-content-block-5"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 hZDlip"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 bzqtlo"><div data-qa-id="split-content-section-0" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 bWblOJ"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 hCNIUX"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 bCDVPy"><h5 class="sc-1oq5f4p-0 gAapzh">RECIPES FOR ACTION</h5><div style="text-decoration:none" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 fIRyka"><div class="sc-908q8o-0 IvetH sc-8dhh8m-0 jvrJmQ"><h2><span>Inspiration for building a better world</span></h2></div></div><div class="sc-908q8o-0 IvetH"><p>Recipes for Action is a collection of ideas to inspire positive change, one action at a time.</p><p>We invite people from around the world to share the varied and creative ways they’re making a positive impact in their communities to inspire others.</p></div><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 hLDoIQ"><a class="sc-1w2vike-0 eAwYhi primary medium" data-qa-id="cms-button-link" href="/en/recipes-for-action?pq=" data-discover="true"><div style="display:inline-flex"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center">Take a Recipe</div></div></a></div></div></div></div><div data-qa-id="split-content-section-1" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 dxSaAo"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 cnFZAP"><div class="sc-1r74fx-0 jumPZO"><img src="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:552,h:380,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/RBse9bHCSD61xGr9dclk" srcSet="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:552,h:380,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/RBse9bHCSD61xGr9dclk 1x, /images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:1104,h:761,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/RBse9bHCSD61xGr9dclk 2x" alt="Illustration of a yellow cat sitting on a purple document with lines of text, surrounded by colorful icons including a red heart, green checkmark, blue thumbs up, water droplet, thread spool, paint palette, and food bowl, representing creativity and productivity elements." width="100%" height="auto" data-qa-id="split-content-section-image" style="max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:10px;aspect-ratio:1115 / 769;height:100%" loading="lazy" class="sc-7wwekv-0 enKkyd"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="cms-block-3fe1255824b04d91be6f295127859129" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 esfmuE sc-1s3itqb-0 iekBux"><div class="sc-1hrlqpl-0 eIHTIZ"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 ljpOFZ"><hr style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0" class="sc-rzizms-0 kXnqWm"/></div><div><div data-qa-id="cms-four-article-highlight" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 sZIIO"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 zzcJc"><div class="sc-908q8o-0 IvetH sc-8dhh8m-0 jvrJmQ"><h2>Make your corner of the world <strong>a little better</strong></h2><p>Discover tips, resources, and inspiration for finding a volunteer opportunity that's right for you.</p></div></div><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 jbIDOz"><div data-qa-id="four-article-highlight-section-0" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 kmZcJB sc-bg7ewo-0 iocUTe"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 haaaJZ"><a href="/en/volunteer-resources/how-tasha-from-canada-builds-community-with-others" tabindex="-1" aria-label="How Tasha From Canada Builds Community With Others" class="sc-12kw2ys-0 hnthed"><img src="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:190,h:190,fit:crop/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/rmnoQKkNRyu3hKVEfUDl" srcSet="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:190,h:190,fit:crop/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/rmnoQKkNRyu3hKVEfUDl 1x, /images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:380,h:380,fit:crop/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/rmnoQKkNRyu3hKVEfUDl 2x" alt="Tasha Van Vlack and the Nonprofit Hive logo" width="190" height="190" data-qa-id="four-article-highlight-section-image" style="max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:100%;aspect-ratio:190 / 190;height:auto" loading="lazy" class="sc-7wwekv-0 enKkyd"/></a></div><a href="/en/volunteer-resources/how-tasha-from-canada-builds-community-with-others" class="sc-12kw2ys-0 hnthed"><h4 class="sc-1oq5f4p-0 dwXwcC">How Tasha From Canada Builds Community With Others</h4></a></div><div data-qa-id="four-article-highlight-section-1" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 kmZcJB sc-bg7ewo-0 iocUTe"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 haaaJZ"><a href="/en/volunteer-resources/volunteer-opportunities-for-high-school-students" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Volunteer Opportunities for High School Students" class="sc-12kw2ys-0 hnthed"><img src="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:190,h:190,fit:crop/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/tYJ26pQivIS2CqTGutQK" srcSet="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:190,h:190,fit:crop/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/tYJ26pQivIS2CqTGutQK 1x, /images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:380,h:380,fit:crop/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/tYJ26pQivIS2CqTGutQK 2x" alt="High school students volunteer to lead an extracurricular activity at a local elementary school." width="190" height="190" data-qa-id="four-article-highlight-section-image" style="max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:100%;aspect-ratio:190 / 190;height:auto" loading="lazy" class="sc-7wwekv-0 enKkyd"/></a></div><a href="/en/volunteer-resources/volunteer-opportunities-for-high-school-students" class="sc-12kw2ys-0 hnthed"><h4 class="sc-1oq5f4p-0 dwXwcC">Volunteer Opportunities for High School Students</h4></a></div><div data-qa-id="four-article-highlight-section-2" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 kmZcJB sc-bg7ewo-0 iocUTe"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 haaaJZ"><a href="/en/volunteer-resources/done-in-a-day-volunteer-opportunities" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Done-in-a-Day Volunteer Opportunities for Busy People" class="sc-12kw2ys-0 hnthed"><img src="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:190,h:190,fit:crop/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/BzCdIIRUqy6y2kqcEadw" srcSet="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:190,h:190,fit:crop/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/BzCdIIRUqy6y2kqcEadw 1x, /images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:380,h:380,fit:crop/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/BzCdIIRUqy6y2kqcEadw 2x" alt="volunteers participate in a tree planting activity" width="190" height="190" data-qa-id="four-article-highlight-section-image" style="max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:100%;aspect-ratio:190 / 190;height:auto" loading="lazy" class="sc-7wwekv-0 enKkyd"/></a></div><a href="/en/volunteer-resources/done-in-a-day-volunteer-opportunities" class="sc-12kw2ys-0 hnthed"><h4 class="sc-1oq5f4p-0 dwXwcC">Done-in-a-Day Volunteer Opportunities for Busy People</h4></a></div><div data-qa-id="four-article-highlight-section-3" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 kmZcJB sc-bg7ewo-0 iocUTe"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 haaaJZ"><a href="/en/volunteer-resources/10-volunteer-opportunities" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Want to Engage in Community Service in 2026? 10 Volunteer Opportunities to Try This Week" class="sc-12kw2ys-0 hnthed"><img src="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:190,h:190,fit:crop/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/EcjMpaPSPu5uSTmdnR9X" srcSet="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:190,h:190,fit:crop/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/EcjMpaPSPu5uSTmdnR9X 1x, /images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:380,h:380,fit:crop/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/EcjMpaPSPu5uSTmdnR9X 2x" alt="Two volunteers high-five after cleaning up the local park through a volunteer opportunity." width="190" height="190" data-qa-id="four-article-highlight-section-image" style="max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:100%;aspect-ratio:190 / 190;height:auto" loading="lazy" class="sc-7wwekv-0 enKkyd"/></a></div><a href="/en/volunteer-resources/10-volunteer-opportunities" class="sc-12kw2ys-0 hnthed"><h4 class="sc-1oq5f4p-0 dwXwcC">Want to Engage in Community Service in 2026? 10 Volunteer Opportunities to Try This Week</h4></a></div></div><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 jDENkm"><a class="sc-1w2vike-0 eAwYhi primary medium" href="/en/volunteering-resources?pq=" data-discover="true"><div style="display:inline-flex">Read More</div></a></div></div></div><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 fMvxTR"><hr style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0" class="sc-rzizms-0 kXnqWm"/></div></div></div><div id="cms-block-db78713fcd264335a9023ee9e2317e33" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 esfmuE sc-1s3itqb-0 gdOTML"><div class="sc-1hrlqpl-0 eIHTIZ"><div><div data-qa-id="split-content-block-7"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 hZDlip"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 bzqtlo"><div data-qa-id="split-content-section-0" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 bWblOJ"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 hCNIUX"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 bCDVPy"><h5 class="sc-1oq5f4p-0 gAapzh">Free Community Action Program</h5><div style="text-decoration:none" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 fIRyka"><div class="sc-908q8o-0 IvetH sc-8dhh8m-0 jvrJmQ"><h2>What’s your <strong>big idea?</strong></h2></div></div><div class="sc-908q8o-0 IvetH"><p>If you’ve been dreaming up ways to make an impact in your community but aren't quite sure where to begin (or how to proceed), Idealist can help.</p><p>The <em>Action Incubator Sessions</em> are designed to help you move forward with your big idea for community action. Apply now to access free coaching, resources, and 1:1 support from our organizing experts.</p></div><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 hLDoIQ"><a class="sc-1w2vike-0 eAwYhi primary medium" data-qa-id="cms-button-link" href="/en/action-incubator/sessions" data-discover="true"><div style="display:inline-flex"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center">Sign Up</div></div></a></div></div></div></div><div data-qa-id="split-content-section-1" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 dxSaAo"><div class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 gVGopr"><div class="sc-1r74fx-0 jumPZO"><img src="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:552,h:426,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/0t1Qj1pgSEe1d5jRTDOX" srcSet="/images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:552,h:426,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/0t1Qj1pgSEe1d5jRTDOX 1x, /images/no_metadata/output=format:webp/resize=w:982,h:758,fit:max/quality=value:70/compress/cache=expiry:max/0t1Qj1pgSEe1d5jRTDOX 2x" alt="Illustration of collaboration tools including a hammer, scissors, pencil, lightbulb icon, and four blue circular user profile icons arranged on a light blue cloud background." width="552" height="426" data-qa-id="split-content-section-image" style="max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:contain;border-radius:10px;aspect-ratio:982 / 758;height:auto" loading="lazy" class="sc-7wwekv-0 enKkyd"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="cms-block-5a6548a740e84f2d9c7eb0d148599486" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 bXunNU sc-1s3itqb-0 euVFBW"><div class="sc-1hrlqpl-0 eIHTIZ"><div><div data-qa-id="recommended-actions" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 cCyYpW"><div class="sc-908q8o-0 ihsslo sc-8dhh8m-0 jvrJmQ"><h2><span>Find your next <u>volunteer opportunity</u> on Idealist</span></h2></div><div class="sc-1oq5f4p-0 fdfRPR"><a class="sc-1v38bp9-0 jnCdAl" data-qa-id="tile-carousel-see-all" href="/en/volunteer" data-discover="true">See All Volunteer Opportunities</a></div><div class="sc-vyqctj-0 gQtubM"><div data-qa-id="tile-carousel" class="sc-hl33h9-0 oeJdr"><div style="touch-action:none"><div style="height:338px" class="sc-hl33h9-1 brMKql"><div data-qa-slide-count="4" data-qa-id="tile-carousel-slider" style="--current-page:0;--gutter:8px;--slides-per-page-xs:1;--slides-per-page-sm:1;--slides-per-page-md:3;--slides-per-page-lg:4" class="sc-hl33h9-2 kAWIVd"><div data-qa-id="tile-carousel-slide-0" style="--index:0;--nth-index-xs:0;--nth-index-sm:0;--nth-index-md:0;--nth-index-lg:0" class="sc-hl33h9-3 HtbBX"><div><div></div></div></div><div data-qa-id="tile-carousel-slide-1" style="--index:1;--nth-index-xs:0;--nth-index-sm:0;--nth-index-md:1;--nth-index-lg:1" class="sc-hl33h9-3 HtbBX"><div><div></div></div></div><div data-qa-id="tile-carousel-slide-2" style="--index:2;--nth-index-xs:0;--nth-index-sm:0;--nth-index-md:2;--nth-index-lg:2" class="sc-hl33h9-3 HtbBX"><div><div></div></div></div><div data-qa-id="tile-carousel-slide-3" style="--index:3;--nth-index-xs:0;--nth-index-sm:0;--nth-index-md:0;--nth-index-lg:3" class="sc-hl33h9-3 HtbBX"><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="cms-block-5b0baadabfeb48b99ecbc64ee755f410" class="sc-1pfcxqe-0 esfmuE sc-1s3itqb-0 iekBux"><div class="sc-1hrlqpl-0 eIHTIZ"><div><div class="sc-908q8o-0 IvetH"><p class="ql-align-center"><em>As part of the merger, we’ve updated some of our policies. By using Idealist, you agree to these updated <a href="https://www.idealist.org/en/terms-of-service">Terms of Service</a> and acknowledge our <a href="https://www.idealist.org/en/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.</em></p></div></div></div></div><div data-scroll-trigger-id="cms-content-end" data-qa-id="scroll-trigger-cms-content-end"></div></div></main></div><div></div><footer data-qa-id="footer" class="sc-1rio7oy-0 kEKhiE"><div class="sc-1rio7oy-2 iYUEP"><div class="sc-1rio7oy-3 fCXyJO"><section class="sc-1rio7oy-4 iNcohj"><h4 class="sc-1rio7oy-5 eOIVmd">Volunteer</h4><section class="sc-1rio7oy-6 bQDTiU"><a class="sc-1rio7oy-7 dkQfOv" href="/en/volunteer" data-discover="true">Volunteer Opportunities</a><a class="sc-1rio7oy-7 dkQfOv" href="/en/volunteer?canBeDoneInADay=true" data-discover="true">Done in a Day Opportunities</a><a class="sc-1rio7oy-7 dkQfOv" href="/en/organizations" data-discover="true">Organizations</a><a class="sc-1rio7oy-7 dkQfOv" href="/en/volunteering-resources?pq=" data-discover="true">Volunteer Resources</a><a class="sc-1rio7oy-7 dkQfOv" href="/en/days/get-involved" data-discover="true">Idealist Days</a></section></section><section class="sc-1rio7oy-4 iNcohj"><h4 class="sc-1rio7oy-5 eOIVmd">Find a Job</h4><section class="sc-1rio7oy-6 bQDTiU"><a class="sc-1rio7oy-7 dkQfOv" href="/en/jobs" data-discover="true">Jobs</a><a class="sc-1rio7oy-7 dkQfOv" href="/en/internships" data-discover="true">Internships</a><a class="sc-1rio7oy-7 dkQfOv" href="/en/organizations" data-discover="true">Organizations</a><a class="sc-1rio7oy-7 dkQfOv" href="/nonprofit-salary-explorer" data-discover="true">Salary Explorer</a><a class="sc-1rio7oy-7 dkQfOv" href="/en/careers" data-discover="true">Career Advice</a></section></section><section class="sc-1rio7oy-4 iNcohj"><h4 class="sc-1rio7oy-5 eOIVmd">Post on Idealist</h4><section class="sc-1rio7oy-6 bQDTiU"><a class="sc-1rio7oy-7 dkQfOv" href="/organization" data-discover="true">Post a Job Listing</a><a class="sc-1rio7oy-7 dkQfOv" href="/en/orgs/post-free-volunteer-listings" data-discover="true">Post a Volunteer Opportunity</a><a class="sc-1rio7oy-7 dkQfOv" href="/sign-up-to-post" data-discover="true">Add your Organization</a><a class="sc-1rio7oy-7 dkQfOv" href="/en/orgs/volunteer-engagement-resources" data-discover="true">Volunteer Engagement Resources</a><a class="sc-1rio7oy-7 dkQfOv" href="/grad-schools/exhibit" data-discover="true">Recruit Graduate Students</a></section></section><section class="sc-1rio7oy-4 iNcohj"><h4 class="sc-1rio7oy-5 eOIVmd">About Us</h4><section class="sc-1rio7oy-6 bQDTiU"><a class="sc-1rio7oy-7 dkQfOv" href="/en/about" data-discover="true">Our Story</a><a class="sc-1rio7oy-7 dkQfOv" href="/en/about/our-team" data-discover="true">Our Team</a><a class="sc-1rio7oy-7 dkQfOv" href="/en/insights" data-discover="true">Data &amp; Insights</a><a class="sc-1rio7oy-7 dkQfOv" href="/en/help" data-discover="true">Help Desk</a><a href="https://giving.classy.org/campaign/673245/donate" target="_blank" class="sc-1rio7oy-8 ipobFo">Donate to Idealist</a></section></section></div><section class="sc-1rio7oy-9 iBvOBH"><a class="sc-1rio7oy-10 fEGEVo" href="/en" data-discover="true"><div class="sc-1ck0jli-0 jxFMTe"><img src="/assets/4072af359f6ccab3003ad65daca2651a01609e3d/images/logos/logo-mark.webp" alt="Idealist logo" width="167" height="168" class="sc-1ck0jli-1 lojrlK"/><img src="/assets/4072af359f6ccab3003ad65daca2651a01609e3d/images/logos/logo-idealist.svg" alt="idealist" width="348" height="168" class="sc-1ck0jli-2 hKjsgJ"/></div></a><p class="sc-1rio7oy-11 iYeDbr">Connecting more than 200,000 organizations with millions of people looking for social-impact jobs and volunteer opportunities.</p><div class="sc-1rio7oy-12 hjLIgB"><a class="sc-1rio7oy-1 hUwzSS" aria-label="Follow Idealist" href="https://www.tiktok.com/@joinidealist?utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_source=idealist" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><div role="img" aria-label="social/tiktok icon" style="width:20px;height:20px;color:var(--color-white);--src:url(/assets/4072af359f6ccab3003ad65daca2651a01609e3d/images/icons/normalized/social/tiktok.svg)" class="sc-r8vw27-0 jaFDQv"></div></a><a class="sc-1rio7oy-1 hUwzSS" aria-label="Follow Idealist" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/idealist.org?utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_source=idealist" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><div role="img" aria-label="social/linkedin icon" style="width:20px;height:20px;color:var(--color-white);--src:url(/assets/4072af359f6ccab3003ad65daca2651a01609e3d/images/icons/normalized/social/linkedin.svg)" class="sc-r8vw27-0 jaFDQv"></div></a><a class="sc-1rio7oy-1 hUwzSS" aria-label="Follow Idealist" href="https://instagram.com/joinidealist?utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_source=idealist" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><div role="img" aria-label="social/instagram icon" style="width:20px;height:20px;color:var(--color-white);--src:url(/assets/4072af359f6ccab3003ad65daca2651a01609e3d/images/icons/normalized/social/instagram.svg)" class="sc-r8vw27-0 jaFDQv"></div></a><a class="sc-1rio7oy-1 hUwzSS" aria-label="Follow Idealist" href="https://www.facebook.com/Idealist?utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_source=idealist" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><div role="img" aria-label="social/facebook icon" style="width:20px;height:20px;color:var(--color-white);--src:url(/assets/4072af359f6ccab3003ad65daca2651a01609e3d/images/icons/normalized/social/facebook.svg)" class="sc-r8vw27-0 jaFDQv"></div></a></div></section></div><div class="sc-1rio7oy-13 iPGbhX"><div class="sc-c08ckr-0 jNcSHd"><div data-qa-id="disabled-locale-link-en" title="" class="sc-ethr5-1 fOlUfy">English</div><div data-qa-id="disabled-locale-link-es" title="This page is currently not available in Español" class="sc-ethr5-1 fOlUfy">Español</div><div data-qa-id="disabled-locale-link-pt" title="This page is currently not available in Português" class="sc-ethr5-1 fOlUfy">Português</div></div><div class="sc-1dk5qhw-0 glbBKJ"><a class="sc-1dk5qhw-1 kVbzCy" href="/en/terms-of-service" data-discover="true">Terms</a><a clas